{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0001", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "外邪由太阳（膀胱）入少阳（三焦，半表半里），再入太阴脾；三阴失治深入心肾，最后到肝（厥阴）决生死。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.taiyang", "six_channel.shaoyang", "six_channel.taiyin", "zangfu.pang_guang", "zangfu.san_jiao", "zangfu.pi", "six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c01.s1", "evidence_quote": "如果是进入半表半里就入三焦，三焦是少阳病。", "seg_from": 15, "seg_to": 36, "start_s": 92.35, "end_s": 223.355, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=92s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 92.35, "end_s": 223.35}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0002", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "张仲景病中不用补药：气虚用人参，血虚用白芍（酸收），不用当归；四物汤、八珍汤等补药只宜无病时强身。", "entity_ids": ["person.zhang_zhong_jing", "herb.ren_shen", "herb.shao_yao", "herb.dang_gui", "new.formula.四物汤", "new.formula.八珍汤"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c01.s1", "evidence_quote": "生病的时候不要吃补药", "seg_from": 22, "seg_to": 28, "start_s": 135.84, "end_s": 171.48, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=135s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 135.84, "end_s": 171.48}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0003", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "依《内经》，脾主湿，身上的湿由脾管理。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.pi", "classic.huang_di_nei_jing"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c01.s2", "evidence_quote": "我们讲脾主湿", "seg_from": 39, "seg_to": 40, "start_s": 235.25, "end_s": 246.615, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=235s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 235.25, "end_s": 246.62}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0004", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "新陈代谢是\"一半营养、一半残渣\"：吃进去的必须排出来，只存不排会在体内积聚，阴证时积成实。", "entity_ids": [], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c01.s2", "evidence_quote": "一半是营养，一半是残渣。", "seg_from": 44, "seg_to": 56, "start_s": 259.79, "end_s": 334.18, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=259s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 259.79, "end_s": 334.18}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0005", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "情志致病：思伤脾、忧伤肺；外感入里再加内伤情志，雪上加霜，非常难治。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.pi", "zangfu.fei"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c01.s2", "evidence_quote": "外因内感外来的原进入，对不对？", "seg_from": 61, "seg_to": 70, "start_s": 365.72, "end_s": 428.125, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=365s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 365.72, "end_s": 428.12}, "confidence": 0.75, "asr_note": "原文\"施伤体/撕太深/u肽过\"为\"思伤脾/思太甚/忧太过\"的误识", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0006", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "太阴为阴之初，少阴为阴之中，厥阴为阴之尽；三阴病多见寒证，到厥阴可见热证回复、寒热错杂。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.taiyin", "six_channel.shaoyin", "six_channel.jueyin"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c01.s3", "evidence_quote": "所以会看到寒热并结的现象。", "seg_from": 72, "seg_to": 78, "start_s": 436.49, "end_s": 478.5, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=436s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 436.49, "end_s": 478.5}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "优势英之粗=阴之初；哨阴=少阴；厥音=厥阴；阴之境=阴之尽", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0007", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "阴极生阳、阳极生阴：病到厥阴阴尽时阳气会回头，如太极图般圆形旋转，并非阴尽即死。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.jueyin", "concept.yin_yang"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c01.s3", "evidence_quote": "所以我们阴极阴到了极限呢会升。", "seg_from": 79, "seg_to": 86, "start_s": 478.5, "end_s": 524.765, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=478s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 478.5, "end_s": 524.76}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0008", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第273条太阴提纲：腹满而吐、食不下、自利益甚、时腹自痛；若误下，必胸下结硬。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.273", "syndrome.tai_yin_bing", "symptom.fu_man", "new.symptom.食不下", "symptom.zi_li", "new.symptom.胸下结硬"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c02", "evidence_quote": "太阴之为病，腹满而吐食不下。", "seg_from": 90, "seg_to": 93, "start_s": 547.48, "end_s": 563.0, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=547s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 547.48, "end_s": 563.0}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "倪师称\"第两百八十七条\"（讲义编号），即宋本第273条", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0009", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "脾主腹、主湿：见病人腹部肿大即知脾功能失常、湿盛；脾肿大顶到胃，则吐、吃不下。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.pi", "zangfu.wei", "symptom.fu_man"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c02", "evidence_quote": "脾主属腹，那脾又主湿", "seg_from": 96, "seg_to": 105, "start_s": 572.14, "end_s": 644.35, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=572s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 572.14, "end_s": 644.35}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0010", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "脾喜燥恶湿：脾管湿但不喜湿盛，湿太盛则脾功能出问题。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.pi"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c02", "evidence_quote": "脾脏呢喜欢干燥，不喜欢湿", "seg_from": 100, "seg_to": 101, "start_s": 593.36, "end_s": 609.67, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=593s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 593.36, "end_s": 609.67}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0011", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "问诊辨脾胰：问饿不饿（属脾），问吃东西有无味道（如同嚼蜡提示\"甜肉\"即胰有问题）。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.pi"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c02", "evidence_quote": "我是如同嚼蜡，吃东西没有味道", "seg_from": 108, "seg_to": 116, "start_s": 652.87, "end_s": 693.605, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=652s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 652.87, "end_s": 693.61}, "confidence": 0.6, "asr_note": "甜肉/宜脏/仪脏=胰脏", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0012", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "contraindication", "statement": "太阴腹满内无燥屎，若误认为阳明而用小承气汤、调胃承气汤攻下，寒凉药使病更重，出现胸下结硬、腹痛。", "entity_ids": ["formula.xiao_cheng_qi_tang", "formula.diao_wei_cheng_qi_tang", "symptom.fu_man", "new.symptom.胸下结硬"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c02", "evidence_quote": "你攻下了以后，因为功下的药都是寒凉的药啊", "seg_from": 118, "seg_to": 121, "start_s": 700.88, "end_s": 739.85, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=700s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 700.88, "end_s": 739.85}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0013", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第274条太阴中风四肢烦疼：脾主四肢、主肌肉，湿盛黏滞使新津液无法替换旧津液，故四肢烦疼。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.274", "new.symptom.四肢烦疼", "zangfu.pi", "zangfu.ji_rou"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c03", "evidence_quote": "因为呢脾除了主父主食以外，脾又主四肢", "seg_from": 124, "seg_to": 141, "start_s": 747.13, "end_s": 840.93, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=747s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 747.13, "end_s": 840.93}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0014", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "久不运动肌肉易酸痛；运动出汗后补充水分，新津液替换旧津液，酸痛即去，运动对脾很好。", "entity_ids": ["zangfu.pi", "zangfu.ji_rou"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c03", "evidence_quote": "新的精液把旧的精液补回去了，酸痛就去掉。", "seg_from": 135, "seg_to": 138, "start_s": 799.13, "end_s": 816.535, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=799s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 799.13, "end_s": 816.53}, "confidence": 0.7, "asr_note": "精液=津液", "source": "llm_read"}
