{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0016", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "第276条太阴病脉浮可发汗，用桂枝汤；因里湿盛，加白术、茯苓（等量）更稳妥。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.276", "formula.gui_zhi_tang", "herb.bai_zhu", "herb.fu_ling", "pulse.fu", "method.fa_han"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c03", "evidence_quote": "可以开桂枝汤，加什么白术、茯苓。", "seg_from": 147, "seg_to": 154, "start_s": 861.24, "end_s": 914.87, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=861s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 861.24, "end_s": 914.87}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0017", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "herb_property", "statement": "茯苓偏于利尿，白术偏于祛湿；在肌肉层的湿，二者一般开等量。", "entity_ids": ["herb.fu_ling", "herb.bai_zhu"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c03", "evidence_quote": "茯苓呢比较是利尿，白术呢比较是祛湿。", "seg_from": 151, "seg_to": 152, "start_s": 877.75, "end_s": 892.73, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=877s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 877.75, "end_s": 892.73}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0018", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "太阴兼太阳中风用桂枝汤加术苓：桂枝三钱、白芍三钱，加生姜、甘草、大枣，再加白术三钱、茯苓三钱。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_tang", "herb.gui_zhi", "herb.shao_yao", "herb.sheng_jiang", "herb.gan_cao", "herb.da_zao", "herb.bai_zhu", "herb.fu_ling"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c03", "evidence_quote": "白术三前茯苓三钱绝对可以把它治好", "seg_from": 154, "seg_to": 154, "start_s": 902.59, "end_s": 914.87, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=902s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 902.59, "end_s": 914.87}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "三前=三钱；白烧=白芍；参姜刚到=生姜甘草", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0019", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "prognosis", "statement": "第275条太阴欲解时（亥至丑）：病人半夜饿醒能吃、腹满减、小便增多、不再吐，表示太阴病正在恢复。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.275", "syndrome.tai_yin_bing", "symptom.fu_man"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c03", "evidence_quote": "我的肚子很饿，醒过来吃东西好", "seg_from": 155, "seg_to": 161, "start_s": 914.97, "end_s": 955.55, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=914s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 914.97, "end_s": 955.55}, "confidence": 0.7, "asr_note": "害到走=亥至丑；止午=子丑（ASR 混乱）", "source": "llm_read"}
