{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0024", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "concept_definition", "statement": "经方早于张仲景而存在，并非其发明；经方药性依据已失传的《胎胪药录》（源自神农本草）。", "entity_ids": ["concept.jing_fang", "person.zhang_zhong_jing", "new.book.胎胪药录", "classic.shen_nong_ben_cao_jing"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c04.s2", "evidence_quote": "经方呢是张仲景之前就有的东西，不是张仲景发明的", "seg_from": 211, "seg_to": 213, "start_s": 1194.022, "end_s": 1212.542, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1194s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1194.02, "end_s": 1212.54}, "confidence": 0.65, "asr_note": "开炉药露/开鲁药录推定为\"胎胪药录\"", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0025", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "herb_property", "statement": "附子配伍用意：炮附子配生姜用于去水；生附子配干姜用于救逆（心衰、里寒恶寒）；水犯心脏时干姜、生姜同用以加速排水。", "entity_ids": ["herb.fu_zi", "herb.sheng_jiang", "herb.gan_jiang", "zangfu.xin"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c04.s2", "evidence_quote": "当你用泡腹子跟生姜的时候，这两个是去水", "seg_from": 214, "seg_to": 224, "start_s": 1213.382, "end_s": 1287.432, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1213s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1213.38, "end_s": 1287.43}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0026", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "herb_property", "statement": "祛湿药要按部位选：白术祛湿、炮附子驱寒；肛门痔疮流脓黏稠不用白术，可选赤小豆等。", "entity_ids": ["herb.bai_zhu", "herb.fu_zi", "herb.chi_xiao_dou"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c04.s2", "evidence_quote": "那樟木你就不会用白术啊。", "seg_from": 228, "seg_to": 232, "start_s": 1297.842, "end_s": 1327.107, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1297s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1297.84, "end_s": 1327.11}, "confidence": 0.65, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0027", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "clause_interpretation", "statement": "第278条手足自温者系在太阴：手脚温表示肠胃功能尚在；太阴湿盛当发黄，若小便自利，湿有出路则不发黄。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.278", "symptom.fa_huang", "symptom.xiao_bian_zi_li", "pulse.huan"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c05", "evidence_quote": "手脚是温温的，代表肠胃的功能还是有", "seg_from": 234, "seg_to": 242, "start_s": 1335.592, "end_s": 1383.237, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1335s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1335.59, "end_s": 1383.24}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0028", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "治太阴、治阴证一定要利小便：小便保持通畅就不会发黄、病情不会恶化（肝硬化、阴黄亦然）；实脾是利小便而非利大便。", "entity_ids": ["method.li_xiao_bian", "symptom.fa_huang", "new.concept.实脾"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c05", "evidence_quote": "治太阴治阴症，要一定要利小便", "seg_from": 243, "seg_to": 246, "start_s": 1383.792, "end_s": 1413.797, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1383s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1383.79, "end_s": 1413.8}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0029", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "prognosis", "statement": "第278条脾家实：脾功能强时，即使暴烦下利一日十余次也会自止，腐秽自去；以小便是否通利判断。", "entity_ids": ["clause.shl.278", "new.concept.脾家实", "symptom.xia_li"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c05", "evidence_quote": "即使是你下力，一天之下一定会自己止掉。", "seg_from": 248, "seg_to": 257, "start_s": 1419.992, "end_s": 1466.742, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1419s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1419.99, "end_s": 1466.74}, "confidence": 0.8, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0030", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "问口渴与否及想喝冷水或热水即可辨寒热，电话问诊也能判断。", "entity_ids": ["new.symptom.口渴", "concept.han_re"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c05", "evidence_quote": "你口渴想喝什么水啊，你就知道寒热如何了。", "seg_from": 260, "seg_to": 262, "start_s": 1472.082, "end_s": 1494.262, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1472s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1472.08, "end_s": 1494.26}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0031", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "treatment_principle", "statement": "阳证通利大便，阴证通利小便；实脾时（如实脾饮）一定要问病人小便情况。", "entity_ids": ["method.li_xiao_bian", "new.concept.实脾"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c05", "evidence_quote": "所以在阳症的时候，我们通理大便。", "seg_from": 265, "seg_to": 267, "start_s": 1505.602, "end_s": 1526.907, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1505s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1505.6, "end_s": 1526.91}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "食脾=实脾；通便便小练=通利小便", "source": "llm_read"}
