{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0033", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "桂枝加芍药汤：桂枝三钱、芍药加倍为六钱，加炙甘草、生姜三片、大枣，煮取三碗分服；不加饴糖（加饴糖即小建中汤）。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_jia_shao_yao_tang", "formula.xiao_jian_zhong_tang", "herb.gui_zhi", "herb.shao_yao", "herb.gan_cao", "herb.sheng_jiang", "herb.da_zao", "herb.jiao_yi"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c06.s1", "evidence_quote": "芍药就用六钱", "seg_from": 278, "seg_to": 290, "start_s": 1585.392, "end_s": 1670.572, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1585s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1585.39, "end_s": 1670.57}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0034", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "herb_property", "statement": "白芍专治腹中寒水累积、血行不畅所致的阵发性疼痛，痛经、肠痛亦可用。", "entity_ids": ["herb.shao_yao", "symptom.fu_tong"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c06.s1", "evidence_quote": "女孩子的月经痛你也可以用白芍啊", "seg_from": 280, "seg_to": 281, "start_s": 1603.432, "end_s": 1619.897, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1603s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1603.43, "end_s": 1619.9}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0035", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "herb_property", "statement": "甘味易生湿，太阴本有湿，故桂枝加芍药汤不加饴糖。", "entity_ids": ["herb.jiao_yi"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c06.s1", "evidence_quote": "甜味的东西会深思", "seg_from": 291, "seg_to": 292, "start_s": 1670.572, "end_s": 1680.477, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1670s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1670.57, "end_s": 1680.48}, "confidence": 0.75, "asr_note": "深思=生湿；胰糖=饴糖", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0036", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "倪师治小儿血癌（脾湿盛、腹胀、手脚冰冷、不渴）：桂枝汤重用芍药，加生附子（小儿二钱、成人五六钱）及茯苓利湿，去寒湿以复阳。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_tang", "herb.shao_yao", "herb.fu_zi", "herb.fu_ling", "new.disease.血癌"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c06.s2", "evidence_quote": "我用桂汤汤重用芍药", "seg_from": 304, "seg_to": 311, "start_s": 1731.602, "end_s": 1775.082, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1731s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1731.6, "end_s": 1775.08}, "confidence": 0.6, "asr_note": "生腹/参附=生附子；白虎汤汤福灵疑为\"茯苓\"之误识", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0037", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "diagnostic_rule", "statement": "判断好转：能睡、能吃、二便正常、手脚由冷转热；第五胸椎压痛消失。", "entity_ids": [], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c06.s2", "evidence_quote": "第五次按下去他不痛就好了。", "seg_from": 312, "seg_to": 314, "start_s": 1775.082, "end_s": 1795.587, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1775s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1775.08, "end_s": 1795.59}, "confidence": 0.75, "asr_note": "第五支/第五针=第五胸椎", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0038", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "formula_composition", "statement": "桂枝加大黄汤：大黄与桂枝约一比三（如桂枝三钱、大黄一钱）；病在阴脏，攻下只宜轻下，不可用到阳明的重量。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_jia_da_huang_tang", "herb.da_huang", "herb.gui_zhi"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c06.s3", "evidence_quote": "桂枝汤里面大黄是一，桂枝是三", "seg_from": 324, "seg_to": 328, "start_s": 1834.432, "end_s": 1869.942, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1834s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1834.43, "end_s": 1869.94}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
