{"kp_id": "shl-006.kp0040", "video_id": "shl-006", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "六经辨证中太阴以脾为主而不以肺为主；脾为肺之母，治好脾则肺自恢复，肺病另见《金匮》。", "entity_ids": ["six_channel.taiyin", "zangfu.pi", "zangfu.fei", "classic.jin_gui_yao_lve", "concept.liu_jing"], "chapter_id": "shl-006.c07", "evidence_quote": "太阴的候是以脾为主，不以肺为主。", "seg_from": 345, "seg_to": 360, "start_s": 1946.722, "end_s": 2028.917, "citation": {"youtube_id": "9zCCln-3KaE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9zCCln-3KaE&t=1946s", "series": "shl", "episode": 6, "title": "倪海廈《傷寒論》細分版： 6太陰症", "start_s": 1946.72, "end_s": 2028.92}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
